{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">On your way to your flight something happens, most of the lights suddenly go out, leaving the airport in darkness. The boarding gates are locked, and the exit leads right back to the terminal.\u00a0Gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/e8f469df9f334ec158d00d47dc09c182.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/e8f469df9f334ec158d00d47dc09c182.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/e8f469df9f334ec158d00d47dc09c182.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each loop contains a hidden number for the full access code. The code is procedurally generated and changes with each loop, storing your input along the way. The number can be found on walls, ceilings or floor, it can also be hidden as formed objects or even in patterns such as flickering lights, sounds and movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/3a286ba48d4be1d9509b9067476ecc63.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/3a286ba48d4be1d9509b9067476ecc63.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/3a286ba48d4be1d9509b9067476ecc63.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the number is found it can be submitted into the keypad device. Collect the full 10-digit code, gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/ecb8718a061c920f469a847fab124b55.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/ecb8718a061c920f469a847fab124b55.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/ecb8718a061c920f469a847fab124b55.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not alone! Be aware of the\u00a0unknown entity that lurks around the airport, hunting you with its terrifying presence. Must be avoided at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/c3c7b858d294cb7aea2d3164a2d5494b.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/c3c7b858d294cb7aea2d3164a2d5494b.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/c3c7b858d294cb7aea2d3164a2d5494b.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive and realistic experience with minimal user interface and chilling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an endless airport terminal and survive encounters with an evil entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze and submit hidden numbers, throughout the loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic player movement system with camera features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856670?t=1753721255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856670?t=1753721255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/199610407ef16aa75380c66b7216cbf1a43a3931/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753721255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/199610407ef16aa75380c66b7216cbf1a43a3931/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753721255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">On your way to your flight something happens, most of the lights suddenly go out, leaving the airport in darkness. The boarding gates are locked, and the exit leads right back to the terminal.\u00a0Gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/e8f469df9f334ec158d00d47dc09c182.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/e8f469df9f334ec158d00d47dc09c182.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/e8f469df9f334ec158d00d47dc09c182.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each loop contains a hidden number for the full access code. The code is procedurally generated and changes with each loop, storing your input along the way. The number can be found on walls, ceilings or floor, it can also be hidden as formed objects or even in patterns such as flickering lights, sounds and movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/3a286ba48d4be1d9509b9067476ecc63.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/3a286ba48d4be1d9509b9067476ecc63.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/3a286ba48d4be1d9509b9067476ecc63.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the number is found it can be submitted into the keypad device. Collect the full 10-digit code, gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/ecb8718a061c920f469a847fab124b55.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/ecb8718a061c920f469a847fab124b55.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/ecb8718a061c920f469a847fab124b55.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not alone! Be aware of the\u00a0unknown entity that lurks around the airport, hunting you with its terrifying presence. Must be avoided at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/c3c7b858d294cb7aea2d3164a2d5494b.poster.avif?t=1753721255\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/c3c7b858d294cb7aea2d3164a2d5494b.webm?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/c3c7b858d294cb7aea2d3164a2d5494b.mp4?t=1753721255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive and realistic experience with minimal user interface and chilling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an endless airport terminal and survive encounters with an evil entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze and submit hidden numbers, throughout the loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic player movement system with camera features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Digital Star Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/2f3c68ea4f144a7d2e5a6a140a6ba33d5e2ec1a7/header.jpg?t=1753721255","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165937,"mp4":{"4